<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/CSS/about.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include("navbar") %>
    <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-container">
            <div class="about-left">
                <span class="section-badge">
                    ⚡ About ChargeNest
                </span>
                <h1>
                    Building the Future of
                    Smart EV Charging
                    for Apartment Communities
                </h1>
                <p>
                    ChargeNest is a modern SaaS platform designed to simplify EV charging
                    management for apartment communities. We help residents reserve charging
                    slots, monitor charger availability in real time, and give property
                    managers complete control through one intelligent dashboard.
                </p>
                <div class="about-buttons">
                    <a href="/register" class="primary-btn">
                        Get Started
                    </a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="secondary-btn">
                        Contact Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-right">
                <!-- Illustration goes here -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="our-story">
        <div class="story-container">
            <div class="story-left">
                <span class="section-badge">
                    Our Story
                </span>
                <h2>
                    Solving the Everyday Challenges
                    of EV Charging
                </h2>
            </div>
            <div class="story-right">
                <p>
                    As electric vehicles become increasingly common, apartment communities
                    face a growing challenge—limited charging stations, unorganized usage,
                    and uncertainty about charger availability. Residents often waste time
                    waiting for chargers, while property managers struggle to monitor and
                    coordinate charging schedules efficiently.
                </p>
                <p>
                    ChargeNest was created to eliminate these challenges. Our platform
                    brings together smart slot booking, real-time charger monitoring,
                    automated notifications, and powerful management tools into one
                    seamless solution that benefits both residents and apartment
                    administrators.
                </p>
                <p>
                    We believe EV charging should be as convenient as booking a parking
                    space—simple, transparent, and accessible for everyone.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <%- include("footer") %>
</body>
</html>